{
  "about": "Council regression set: fixed agent answers (or, for kind \"supreme\" and \"options\", the frozen inputs of the Supreme Council and the Policy review Options step) and the reading a good answer must give. The figures are frozen test inputs (copied once from the app's own feeds), never shown as data. Run with `npm run council:regress` against the AI model set in the app; `npm run council:record` records it on the referee model and CI replays that recording (README.md). Change a case only by adding a new id; a case that fails is not edited to pass.",
